        body += '<section class="prose"><h2>Local-only sale-tax overlay tool</h2><p>Enter generic assumptions to see how sale value, basis, assumed sale costs, a main-home exclusion, and the California 1% add-on interact. A transfer-year sale is not assumed to have zero gain: the illustration calculates sale value less entered costs and basis. The separate transfer-tax estimate is not netted in that gain formula, and recording fees, federal tax, deductions, losses and other return effects are not fully modeled. Inputs stay in browser memory only and are not stored or transmitted. This is an illustration, not a return, advice, or forecast.</p><div class="calculator"><label>Sale value at sale date ($) <input id="sell-value" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Enter privately"></label><label>Tax basis at sale ($) <input id="sell-basis" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Generally date-of-death value; exceptions apply"></label><label>Depreciation previously claimed ($) <input id="sell-dep" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="For recapture estimate (rental paths)"></label><label>Sale costs excluding transfer tax (%) <input id="sell-costs" type="number" min="0" max="30" step="0.5" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>Local documentary transfer-tax rate (%) <input id="sell-dtt" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.01" placeholder="From the local enacted schedule"></label><label>Other taxable income before modeled gain ($, optional) <input id="sell-other" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="For the 1% add-on test"></label><label>Sale timing <select id="sell-timing"><option value="later">Later sale (after the transfer year)</option><option value="transfer">Sale in the transfer tax year</option></select></label><label>Main-home exclusion (section 121) <select id="sell-121"><option value="0">None claimed</option><option value="250000">Up to $250,000</option><option value="500000">Up to $500,000 (joint)</option></select></label><button id="sell-run" type="button">Run illustration</button><button id="sell-clear" type="button">Clear</button><p id="sell-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">No calculation run.</p></div></section>'
        body += '<section class="prose"><h2>Live-path imputed-rent comparison</h2><p>Living in a home one owns consumes housing that would otherwise be rented. Enter a monthly market rent and the annual carrying cost of the live path to see the net lifestyle position versus selling and investing. Inputs stay in browser memory only.</p><div class="calculator"><label>Monthly market rent / imputed rent ($) <input id="live-rent" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="From written comparables"></label><label>Annual carrying cost of the live path ($) <input id="live-cost" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Tax, insurance, utilities, maintenance"></label><label>Net sale proceeds if sold instead ($) <input id="live-proceeds" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="From the waterfall"></label><button id="live-run" type="button">Compare</button><button id="live-clear" type="button">Clear</button><p id="live-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">No calculation run.</p></div></section>'
