        body += '<section class="prose"><h2>Multi-regime local-only tool</h2><p>Enter only generic or privately held assumptions on a device you control. This is an illustration, not a historical backtest, probability or forecast. Inputs stay in browser memory and are not stored or transmitted; refresh to clear them.</p><div class="calculator"><label>Starting amount <input id="bw-amount" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Enter privately"></label><label>Horizon (years) <select id="bw-years"><option value="10">10</option><option value="20">20</option><option value="30" selected>30</option><option value="40">40</option><option value="50">50</option></select></label><label>Equity share after staging (%) <input id="bw-equity" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>Cash / Treasury yield (%) <input id="bw-cash" type="number" min="0" max="25" step="0.1" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>Annual equity volatility (%) <input id="bw-vol" type="number" min="0" max="60" step="1" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>Regime sequence <select id="bw-preset"><option value="constant">Constant-rate comparison</option><option value="greatinflation">Inflation shock then disinflation</option><option value="crash1929">1929-shaped crash and slow recovery</option><option value="crash2008" selected>2007–09-shaped crash and recovery</option><option value="lostdecade">Weak decade then recovery</option><option value="stopstart">Recurring shocks</option></select></label><label>Additional one-year equity fall (%) <input id="bw-shock" type="number" min="0" max="95" step="1" placeholder="Optional stress assumption"></label><label>Year of that fall (0 = none) <input id="bw-shock-year" type="number" min="0" max="50" step="1" placeholder="Choose timing"></label><label>Entry schedule <select id="bw-staging"><option value="0">Invest immediately</option><option value="24">Stage over 24 months</option><option value="30">Stage over 30 months</option><option value="36">Stage over 36 months</option></select></label><label>Illustrative paths <select id="bw-paths"><option value="120">120</option><option value="240" selected>240</option><option value="480">480</option></select></label><button id="bw-run" type="button">Run illustration</button><button id="bw-clear" type="button">Clear</button><p id="bw-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">No calculation run.</p></div><div class="chart-frame" id="bw-chart"></div></section>'
        body += prose("Interpretation and limits", "The selected regime path is a transparent sensitivity, not a statistical forecast. It does not incorporate household tax returns, property cash flows, insurance quotes, legal eligibility, transaction costs, dividends or changing personal circumstances. Compare percentiles and drawdowns only after the assumptions have been documented privately; do not publish a household-specific result.")
