        body += '<section class="prose"><h2>Local-only sensitivity tool</h2><p>Enter generic assumptions to compare immediate investment with a phased schedule and one selected shock. This is an illustration, not a forecast, advice or historical backtest. Enter no sensitive information on a shared device; values are not stored or transmitted. The broader multi-regime tool is on the <a href="black-swan.html">Black-swan conditions</a> page.</p><div class="calculator"><label>Starting amount <input id="phase-amount" type="number" min="0" step="10" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Enter privately"></label><label>Staging months <input id="phase-months" type="number" min="24" max="36" step="1" value="24"></label><label>Annual Treasury yield (%) <input id="phase-yield" type="number" min="-5" max="30" step="0.1" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>Annual equity price drift (%) <input id="phase-equity" type="number" min="-50" max="50" step="0.1" placeholder="Enter assumption"></label><label>One-time equity decline (%) <input id="phase-crash" type="number" min="0" max="90" step="1" placeholder="Use a sourced stress depth"></label><label>Crash month (staging months + 1 = just after staging) <input id="phase-crash-month" type="number" min="1" max="37" step="1" placeholder="Choose timing"></label><label>Renewal yield after the shock (%) <input id="phase-renewal" type="number" min="-5" max="30" step="0.1" placeholder="Optional reinvestment case"></label><button id="phase-run" type="button">Run illustration</button><button id="phase-clear" type="button">Clear</button><p id="phase-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">No calculation run.</p></div></section>'
